        // changing character appearance." So it is BOTH. The panel is a
        // full-height display in PORTRAIT (720 x 1280), showing your profile;
        // walking up to it and pressing E opens the look editor, because the
        // bedroom's room type (data/rooms.ron) lists `customize_appearance`.
